olvents, and fuel additives; and resin products, including carbon, pure, and hydrogenated hydrocarbon resins, as well as phenolics for specialty chemicals, coatings, adhesives, construction, automotive, lithium-ion batteries, energy storage, petroleum, and other industries. In addition, it offers ordinary cement and Portland pozzolana cement for construction under the Priya Cement brand. Rain Industries Limited was formerly known as Rain Commodities Limited and changed its name to Rain Industries Limited in July 2013. The company was incorporated in 1974 and is based in Hyderabad, India."}}